  "id": "capsaicin",
  "term": "capsaicin",
  "definition": "Capsaicin is a chili pepper extract with pain-relieving effects, especially when applied to the skin for peripheral nerve pain. It acts on primary sensory peripheral neurons and has also been studied for its effects on substance P and related neuropeptides.",
